<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Summit raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Summit raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co upgraded its rating for Summit Bancorp to buy from market perform, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares rose 1/2 to 44 in early Tuesday trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
